message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Two-dimensional Ising Monte Carlo models for phase-ordering kinetics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thompson
    given-names: Django
repository-code: "https://github.com/djangothompson12-alt/ising-monte-carlo"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Model A Metropolis and Model B Kawasaki Monte Carlo engines
  for two-dimensional phase-ordering kinetics, including anisotropic
  couplings, concentration sweeps, correlation-based domain metrology,
  and interactive visualizers.
keywords:
  - Ising model
  - Monte Carlo
  - phase-ordering kinetics
  - Kawasaki dynamics
  - materials science
